			<div class="content" id="post-content-2835516">
									

<p>I mean, I really loved the whole thing. The concept of suit with neural connections coupled with a mysterious super computer was Awesone. But when it came to the test logs it became confusing as to how one interacts with SCP-2209-1 and generally how it operates. When the subject get's into the Sphere and initiates the &quot;Experience&quot; does the sphere itself exhibit the zero gravity? Or spin, or move, or something? How does the Dr perceive these effects? I just feel like these things could be answered with some simple details so I'm ofcourse still gonna upvote.</p>

